WEBVTT

NOTE Come funziona — VO Italian; WebVTT from TTML (timeline −1h). Soft line breaks for mobile. (en)

1
00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:04.333 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
It starts on the site, with clear prices,

2
00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:08.166 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
a guided path — and behind it there isn't software,
there's a person.

3
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.291 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Lorenzo, a surveyor authorised for
electronic filing of the tax return.

4
00:00:15.291 --> 00:00:19.583 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Answer a few questions.
It takes a minute and the result is instant.

5
00:00:20.208 --> 00:00:23.625 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
And in most cases a clear price,
agreed in advance.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.875 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Here, 490 euros.

7
00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:30.375 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
All inclusive, except the taxes payable to the State.
We calculate those for you.

8
00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:35.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
If your case is particular, you receive a
bespoke quote within one working day.

9
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.125 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
And if the return isn't even due,
we tell you — for free.

10
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:43.416 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
When you're ready, you pay online
securely by card.

11
00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:46.791 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
No surprises afterwards.
The price is the one agreed in advance.

12
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:54.541 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
In your personal area you sign the mandate online
and find the list of documents, explained one by one.

13
00:00:55.125 --> 00:00:59.958 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
You upload them however you prefer: a scan,
or even just a photo taken with your phone.

14
00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:04.833 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
And if you need a self-certification,
you download the form already ready to sign.

15
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:10.916 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
From here on you don't have to do anything else:
we take care of it, and you're never left in the dark.

16
00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:17.625 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
At every step you get an update by email
and in your personal area you always see where your file stands.

17
00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:22.083 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
When the return is sent to the Revenue Agency,
you receive confirmation.

18
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:27.125 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
And at the end you find the official documents in your area.
You download them and keep them.

19
00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:28.000 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Done!

20
00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:31.583 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Your succession
without leaving home.

21
00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:36.250 line:92% position:50% size:90% align:center
Get your quote on the site. It's free.
It only takes a few minutes.
